{"seq":33,"ts":"2026-08-25T11:27:16.126Z","type":"work.add","payload":{"id":"tsk-2s9","title":"Stuck root-item claim blocks fgos return: orphaned runtime claim + no take-side reclaim +…","description":"Stuck root-item claim blocks fgos return: orphaned runtime claim + no take-side reclaim + branch-activity liveness false-positive. A claimed item's runtime claim record (.fgos/runtime/claims/<id>.json) can be orphaned when the originating session never releases it, and two independent gaps then prevent recovery. (1) fgos return requires the durable item.claimRole field to be human/session, but under the post-tsk-40m doing-coordination-redesign, a claim's to==='doing' fold only sets item.claimRole when the move event explicitly carries a role -- a root item claimed via a path that skips this leaves item.claimRole permanently undefined even while item.status reads doing, so return refuses forever with 'was not taken through the pull door (claimed by runner)'. (2) The only reclaim path for an orphaned runtime claim is claim-port.mjs's stale-claim-reclaim block, which only runs when isolate:true (fgos pick, never fgos take) -- and its liveness check (claim-liveness.mjs's lastActivityAt) measures the claim's own fgw/<id> branch's last commit time, which reads 'recently active' whenever ANY legitimate commit lands on that branch for an unrelated reason (e.g. a child item's approve merging into the parent branch) -- so the heuristic never lets a genuinely orphaned claim be reclaimed while children are still landing on it, even though the orphaned claim itself has been dead for hours. Live-hit case: tsk-5x7 (root item, 3 children) -- claimed 2026-08-25T07:08:51Z, never released; blocked return for ~18 minutes across multiple recovery attempts (move todo/doing, take, pick) until manually deleting the orphaned claim file and re-picking. Needs: either return's claimRole check widened to cover whatever the current claim path actually stamps, or take gaining the same stale-claim-reclaim check pick has, or the liveness heuristic distinguishing this claim's own activity from any commit landing on the branch it happens to point at.","kind":"task","status":"todo","deps":[],"risk":"standard","refs":[],"verify":"chưa xác định — P15 bổ sung","tier":"standard","mode":"sync","domain":"coding","stage":"discovery","statusCategory":"todo"},"v":3,"src":"8a6b2f55-2d55-4d33-ac78-199cc301dc97","h":"7ac500a9bbb4543b"}
