{"seq":38,"ts":"2026-08-26T06:32:27.708Z","type":"work.add","payload":{"id":"tsk-1ef","title":"Add a docs/how-to guide for configuring a runner executor to dispatch via the herdr-spawn adapter:…","description":"Add a docs/how-to guide for configuring a runner executor to dispatch via the herdr-spawn adapter: add an executors.<id> entry with invocations[].adapter set to \"herdr-spawn\" (reusing an existing CLI invocation shape like the claude executor), then point a capabilities.<name>.prefer at it so that capability's dispatch runs visibly inside a fresh Herdr pane instead of a captured cli-spawn subprocess. No such how-to exists yet even though the adapter itself (src/runner/dispatch/transport.mjs herdrSpawnAdapter) has been merged and tested since tsk-5x7.","kind":"feature","status":"todo","deps":[],"risk":"light","refs":[],"verify":"chưa xác định — P15 bổ sung","tier":"light","mode":"sync","domain":"coding","stage":"discovery","statusCategory":"todo"},"v":3,"src":"8a6b2f55-2d55-4d33-ac78-199cc301dc97","h":"0ffcedc91f7b2f78"}
